@model PageModel

@{
    var school = Model.School;
}

<main>


  <!-- ==================== PAGE BANNER ==================== -->
  <section class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About @school.Name</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== ABOUT CONTENT ==================== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-layout">

      <div>
        <h2>Our School</h2>
        <p>
          @school.Name is a prominent public secondary institution in Zamfara
          State, Nigeria, established in 1969.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Key Details</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3">
          <li>
            <strong>Location:</strong> Gusau, Zamfara State, Nigeria.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>History:</strong> Founded in 1969, making it over 55 years old.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Recent Developments:</strong> The school and its staff
            quarters underwent extensive rehabilitation and renovation under the
            administration of Governor Dauda Lawal, which included updating the
            premises and constructing new internal road networks.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Notable Alumni:</strong> The institution has a long history
            of producing graduates who pursued careers as medical doctors,
            engineers, and scientists.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Curriculum:</strong> The institution focuses heavily on the
            STEM pipeline, preparing students for senior secondary certificates
            via bodies like WAEC and NECO.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <img class="about-photo mt-4" src="~/images/renovated-campus.jpg" alt="The renovated school campus" loading="lazy" width="1365" height="768">

        <h2 class="mt-5">Infrastructure Upgrades</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          After operating for over 55 years without major structural overhauls,
          the school underwent a massive transformation. The Zamfara State
          government, under Governor Dauda Lawal, executed an extensive
          rehabilitation project. This modernization initiative fully renovated
          the school classrooms, student facilities, and staff quarters,
          alongside paving a newly constructed internal road network across the
          campus.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          At @school.Name, we believe education transforms lives. Our mission is to
          cultivate inquisitive minds, strong character, and a deep sense of purpose
          in every student. We provide a challenging yet nurturing environment where
          young people discover who they are and who they want to become.
        </p>
        <p>
          Through a dynamic blend of rigorous academics, creative expression,
          athletic pursuits, and community engagement, we prepare students not just
          for college, but for lives of meaning and impact.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Core Values</h2>
        <ul class="values-grid mt-3">
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Integrity</h4>
            <p>We act with honesty, transparency, and strong moral principles in every decision.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Respect</h4>
            <p>We honor the dignity of every individual and embrace diverse perspectives.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Excellence</h4>
            <p>We set high expectations and provide the support needed to exceed them.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Community</h4>
            <p>We build meaningful relationships and contribute to the world beyond our campus.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <h3>At a Glance</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Established:</strong> 1969</li>
          <li><strong>Location:</strong> Gusau, Zamfara State, Nigeria</li>
          <li><strong>Type:</strong> Public secondary institution</li>
          <li><strong>Age:</strong> 55+ years</li>
          <li><strong>Focus:</strong> STEM</li>
          <li><strong>Certificates:</strong> WAEC, NECO</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mt-3">Visit Us</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Experience @school.Name in person. Call @school.Phone or email @school.Email to arrange a campus tour.</p>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </section>


</main>
